So this is what it would
look like to my stakeholders.

00:27:26.740 --> 00:27:28.698
And they would actually
be able to come in here

00:27:28.698 --> 00:27:30.950
and interact with any filters
that I put on the page.

00:27:30.950 --> 00:27:33.050
So not only is this a report
that I can share with people,

00:27:33.050 --> 00:27:34.990
but this is I a live
interactive application

00:27:34.990 --> 00:27:38.289
that I can embed inside of my
company's own wiki or block.

00:27:38.289 --> 00:27:40.330
SOLEIL KELLEY: Kind of
here and if I made changes

00:27:40.330 --> 00:27:42.221
to the report over time to--

00:27:42.221 --> 00:27:43.720
basically refreshing
the page, those

00:27:43.720 --> 00:27:45.280
