reflected here, too.

00:27:45.280 --> 00:27:47.488
DAVE OLESON: Yeah, so we
could actually look at this.

00:27:47.488 --> 00:27:50.510
Let's say we came here,
and we went to page 1.

00:27:50.510 --> 00:27:53.420
And I said, oh, I don't
