00:28:07.330 --> 00:28:08.552
by department.

00:28:08.552 --> 00:28:09.760
And then I come back in here.

00:28:09.760 --> 00:28:18.040
And if I refresh this page
and go into preview mode,

00:28:18.040 --> 00:28:20.460
now this report has-- or
this application actually

00:28:20.460 --> 00:28:22.399
that I've created has
updated in real time

00:28:22.399 --> 00:28:24.690
to reflect the latest changes
that I made on my report.

00:28:27.854 --> 00:28:30.041
SOLEIL KELLEY:
That's super cool.

